# ==============================================
# MemeScan Astro - Environment Variables
# ==============================================
# None. This is a static site: nothing here is read at build time or at
# runtime, so there is no .env to create.
#
# Deploy to: the onebox Docker host (x402-facilitator/onebox, alias
# "memescan"). The Dockerfile builds dist/ with `npm run build` and serves it
# from a non-root nginx on 8080, behind the box's Caddy. The public domain is
# MEMESCAN_HOST in onebox/.env, which only Caddy reads; this app never sees it.
